WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.893
Open the bundled conveyor example and wait until it is ready.

2
00:00:23.893 --> 00:00:54.693
Drag the canvas to orbit. Use the wheel to zoom.

3
00:00:54.693 --> 00:01:26.522
Press Shift+F to fit the model, then open Hierarchy.

4
00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:55.498
The Visual settings page contains the language selector.

5
00:01:55.498 --> 00:02:18.262
Switch to Chinese. UI language does not rewrite device names or the project.

6
00:02:18.262 --> 00:02:44.400
Switch back to English. Open contextual help with its button or F1.
